# Bare minimum repo: only the source needed to open and compile the deck
# in a LaTeX editor. Everything else (build output, rendered previews,
# verification scripts, tool config) is regenerated or is local-only.
*
!.gitignore

!avl/
!avl/avl.tex
!avl/avltheme.sty
!avl/parts/
!avl/parts/*.tex
!avl/tikz/
!avl/tikz/*.tex
